{"seq":4,"slug":"habit-analytics","title":"习惯分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/goal-execution-habit-systems/tracking-accountability/habit-analytics","wordCount":1929,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"习惯分析\">习惯分析</h1><h2 id=\"用数据工程思维分析习惯\">用数据工程思维分析习惯</h2><p>程序员擅长分析系统性能、追踪用户行为、优化数据库查询——但很少有人用同样的分析思维来审视自己的习惯数据。<strong>习惯分析</strong>就是将数据工程的方法论应用于个人行为数据，从中发现模式、相关性和优化机会。</p>\n<p>把自己想象成一个复杂的分布式系统。你的每个习惯就是一个微服务，它们之间存在依赖关系、资源竞争和级联效应。习惯分析就是你的 <strong>Observability Stack</strong>——帮助你理解这个系统的运行状态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[原始数据采集] --&gt; B[数据清洗 &amp; 标准化]&#10;    B --&gt; C[描述性分析]&#10;    C --&gt; D[相关性分析]&#10;    D --&gt; E[因果假设]&#10;    E --&gt; F[A/B 实验验证]&#10;    F --&gt; G[策略调整]&#10;    G --&gt; A\">graph TB\n    A[原始数据采集] --&gt; B[数据清洗 &amp; 标准化]\n    B --&gt; C[描述性分析]\n    C --&gt; D[相关性分析]\n    D --&gt; E[因果假设]\n    E --&gt; F[A/B 实验验证]\n    F --&gt; G[策略调整]\n    G --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>习惯分析是把数据工程方法论应用于个人行为数据，从中发现模式、相关性与优化机会——把自己当作一个分布式系统，习惯是微服务，习惯分析就是你的 Observability Stack。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数据管道</strong>：原始采集 → 清洗标准化 → 描述性分析 → 相关性分析 → 因果假设 → A/B 实验 → 策略调整（回到采集）。</li>\n<li><strong>最小可行数据集（MVDS）</strong>：先只追踪 3 个核心指标（习惯完成/未完成、日期，再加上建议维度），避免一次追踪 20 个维度。</li>\n<li><strong>描述性分析</strong>：完成率趋势与时间模式（周初高周末低、月初高月末低、稳定下滑）。</li>\n<li><strong>相关性分析</strong>：用相关系数 r 衡量习惯间关联强度（r≈0.6 运动→编码效率）。</li>\n<li><strong>因果验证</strong>：相关不等于因果，须用 A/B 实验验证后再固化为策略。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据采集-构建你的习惯数据管道\">数据采集：构建你的习惯数据管道</h2><h3 id=\"数据源分类\">数据源分类</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>采集方式</th>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>自动记录</strong></td>\n<td>App/设备自动采集</td>\n<td>步数、屏幕时间、心率</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>半自动</strong></td>\n<td>触发式手动记录</td>\n<td>Toggl 计时、Git commit</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>手动记录</strong></td>\n<td>每日填写</td>\n<td>情绪评分、能量水平、饮食</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>回顾式</strong></td>\n<td>事后回忆</td>\n<td>周度反思、月度总结</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"数据模型设计\">数据模型设计</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const habitEntry = {&#10;  date: &#39;2024-01-15&#39;,&#10;  habits: {&#10;    coding: { done: true, minutes: 120, quality: 4 },&#10;    exercise: { done: true, type: &#39;running&#39;, minutes: 30 },&#10;    reading: { done: false, reason: &#39;too tired&#39; },&#10;    meditation: { done: true, minutes: 10 },&#10;  },&#10;  context: {&#10;    sleepHours: 7.5,&#10;    energyLevel: 7,&#10;    mood: 8,&#10;    stressLevel: 4,&#10;    workload: &#39;normal&#39;,&#10;    weather: &#39;sunny&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  notes: &#39;今天状态很好，晨跑后效率特别高&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> habitEntry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  date: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-01-15'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  habits: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    coding: { done: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, minutes: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quality: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    exercise: { done: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'running'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, minutes: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reading: { done: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'too tired'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    meditation: { done: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, minutes: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  context: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sleepHours: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    energyLevel: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mood: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stressLevel: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    workload: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'normal'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    weather: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sunny'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  notes: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'今天状态很好，晨跑后效率特别高'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"最小可行数据集-mvds\">最小可行数据集（MVDS）</h3><p>不要一开始就追踪 20 个维度，先从最小可行数据集开始：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>必须追踪</th>\n<th>建议追踪</th>\n<th>可选追踪</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>习惯完成/未完成</td>\n<td>持续时间</td>\n<td>完成质量评分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日期</td>\n<td>能量水平(1-10)</td>\n<td>天气</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>睡眠时长</td>\n<td>具体笔记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>情绪评分(1-10)</td>\n<td>饮食记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"描述性分析-看见你的行为模式\">描述性分析：看见你的行为模式</h2><h3 id=\"完成率分析\">完成率分析</h3><p>最基础的分析是各习惯的完成率趋势：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function analyzeCompletionRate(data, habit, period = 7) {&#10;  const recentData = data.slice(-period);&#10;  const completed = recentData.filter((d) =&gt; d.habits[habit]?.done).length;&#10;  const rate = ((completed / period) * 100).toFixed(1);&#10;&#10;  const previousData = data.slice(-period * 2, -period);&#10;  const prevCompleted = previousData.filter((d) =&gt; d.habits[habit]?.done).length;&#10;  const prevRate = ((prevCompleted / period) * 100).toFixed(1);&#10;&#10;  const trend = rate - prevRate;&#10;  const arrow = trend &gt; 0 ? &#39;📈&#39; : trend &lt; 0 ? &#39;📉&#39; : &#39;➡️&#39;;&#10;&#10;  return { rate, prevRate, trend, arrow };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyzeCompletionRate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">habit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> recentData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">period);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> completed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recentData.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d.habits[habit]?.done).</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((completed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> period) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toFixed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> previousData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\